{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "THE DARK ARRIVAL - SHADOWS OF THE PAST",
    "steam_appid": 3295930,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/0bf0ecb4e81d8ef31699739dbac9f4d4.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>In The Dark Arrival</strong>, Jacob is shattered by the loss of his girlfriend and loyal dog,, he struggles to find meaning\u2014until a mysterious letter from his late grandfather draws him back to Hollow Creek, a town he once called home. Now consumed by an oppressive fog and riddled with decay, Hollow Creek harbors unspeakable horrors and dark secrets, including the chilling disappearances of its children. The town\u2019s eerie silence whispers of a sinister connection to the infamous Bell Witch and a curse that refuses to die. The train station, the heart of the town, holds secrets that have been buried for years.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/e4555219116dfca373bca6f2622e1d10.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a harrowing tale of loss, witchcraft, and the supernatural forces lurking in the shadows. As Jacob explores the fog-shrouded streets and crumbling ruins of Hollow Creek, each step drags him deeper into the town\u2019s macabre history and closer to the terrifying truth of the missing children.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/76a3cde220325fd8a4a8110cbe9e47d0.poster.avif?t=1754925251\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/76a3cde220325fd8a4a8110cbe9e47d0.webm?t=1754925251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/76a3cde220325fd8a4a8110cbe9e47d0.mp4?t=1754925251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/20cbe2ca605fc08c5a9d8a8f5781ed7e.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the dread with haunting visuals, spine-tingling soundscapes, face the wrath of vengeful spirits, restless ghosts, and supernatural forces tied to the Bell Witch and an all-encompassing fog that transforms Hollow Creek into a claustrophobic nightmare.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/57b4fd9d96fcced78f5d399aaddf20e8.avif?t=1754925251\" width=800 height=374 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/ee07a7cd140835ebe9faccebc9f496cc.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/2e366f05088e80543ed02b9d4710c51b.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the fog-filled streets, abandoned homes, and eerie landmarks of Hollow Creek, a once-vibrant town now steeped in darkness and despair.\u00a0The mystery of the town unravels as you explore, with every forgotten building hiding another piece of the twisted puzzle. What happened to the children? What dark history has been buried for so long?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/d8ab6787b07984308adb4c48ba095c7d.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/789b105de28ec2d2b6de13f38dd4d581.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span>Experience heart-stopping terror with every step as the hauntingly realistic graphics immerse you in a decaying world of shadows and dread.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/9fb445ec70faa0ead9e6f8a7bf192740.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/2de9657138e092b4cff7e26caeafe4d3.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/15b4f71f4b30b44d5dc27cd3bddaccc9.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/76a88c18f457b25ac8f2fb90603b84ce.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/9994adb127614a37bec486af67990e93.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unravel a gripping tale of loss, mystery, and the supernatural as Jacob uncovers his family\u2019s dark connection to Hollow Creek. This emotional journey will have you questioning everything as you face the terrifying truth behind the Bell Witch\u2019s curse. Will you find redemption, or will the town claim you too.</i><br><strong>Will You Survive the Darkness?</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shadows of Hollow Creek are relentless, and the truth is more horrifying than you can imagine. Can you escape the clutches of the Bell Witch and the haunting cries of the town\u2019s lost souls before it\u2019s too late?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/50e5815f96a82dca395479ea08b972ae.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span><strong>Discover the horror. Save the missing. Face the Witch.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Shadows of the Past</strong> won\u2019t leave you\u2014will you be able to escape them? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/eef4d94155739faebd70f4924a55487e.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/0bf0ecb4e81d8ef31699739dbac9f4d4.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>In The Dark Arrival</strong>, Jacob is shattered by the loss of his girlfriend and loyal dog,, he struggles to find meaning\u2014until a mysterious letter from his late grandfather draws him back to Hollow Creek, a town he once called home. Now consumed by an oppressive fog and riddled with decay, Hollow Creek harbors unspeakable horrors and dark secrets, including the chilling disappearances of its children. The town\u2019s eerie silence whispers of a sinister connection to the infamous Bell Witch and a curse that refuses to die. The train station, the heart of the town, holds secrets that have been buried for years.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/e4555219116dfca373bca6f2622e1d10.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a harrowing tale of loss, witchcraft, and the supernatural forces lurking in the shadows. As Jacob explores the fog-shrouded streets and crumbling ruins of Hollow Creek, each step drags him deeper into the town\u2019s macabre history and closer to the terrifying truth of the missing children.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/76a3cde220325fd8a4a8110cbe9e47d0.poster.avif?t=1754925251\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/76a3cde220325fd8a4a8110cbe9e47d0.webm?t=1754925251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite