.</i><br><strong>Will You Survive the Darkness?</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shadows of Hollow Creek are relentless, and the truth is more horrifying than you can imagine. Can you escape the clutches of the Bell Witch and the haunting cries of the town\u2019s lost souls before it\u2019s too late?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/50e5815f96a82dca395479ea08b972ae.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span><strong>Discover the horror. Save the missing. Face the Witch.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Shadows of the Past</strong> won\u2019t leave you\u2014will you be able to escape them? <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3295930/extras/eef4d94155739faebd70f4924a55487e.avif?t=1754925251\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p>",
